## ConversionsApi

### Create advertiser defined events
## Create advertiser defined events
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/advertiser_defined_events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "items": "<string>"
}


### Delete advertiser defined events
## Delete advertiser defined events
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/advertiser_defined_events?eventNames={{eventNames}}
Accept: application/json

### Get advertiser defined events
## Get advertiser defined events
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/advertiser_defined_events
Accept: application/json

### Update advertiser defined events
## Update advertiser defined events
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/advertiser_defined_events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "items": "<string>"
}

